suing on behalf of California owners under

283
00:10:59,195 --> 00:11:01,229
California consumer law.

284
00:11:01,580 --> 00:11:04,148
So far, two of our five problems

285
00:11:04,148 --> 00:11:06,154
belong to General Motors,

286
00:11:06,154 --> 00:11:08,882
the ten-speed and the eight-speed.

287
00:11:09,062 --> 00:11:10,918
And the twist is that GM's own

288
00:11:10,918 --> 00:11:13,393
customers have been caught between them.

289
00:11:13,573 --> 00:11:16,125
If you bought a twenty nineteen truck,

290
00:11:16,125 --> 00:11:18,409
you may have an eight-speed with a

291
00:11:18,409 --> 00:11:20,760
shudder case, or a ten-speed with a

292
00:11:20,760 --> 00:11:23,581
lockup recall, depending on the engine and

293
00:11:23,581 --> 00:11:23,917
trim.

294
00:11:24,097 --> 00:11:25,343
Same model year,

295
00:11:25,343 --> 00:11:29,391
same badge, two very different transmission stories.

296
00:11:29,571 --> 00:11:31,802
Always confirm which one is in the

297
00:11:31,802 --> 00:11:32,195
truck.

298
00:11:32,546 --> 00:11:36,070
Problem number three is the Ford F-150's

299
00:11:36,070 --> 00:11:37,921
unexpected downshift.

300
00:11:38,101 --> 00:11:39,655
On April fourteenth,

301
00:11:39,655 --> 00:11:43,151
twenty twenty-six, Ford recalled one million,

302
00:11:43,151 --> 00:11:45,792
three hundred ninety-two thousand,

303
00:11:45,792 --> 00:11:49,599
nine hundred thirty-five twenty fifteen to twenty

304
00:11:49,599 --> 00:11:53,639
seventeen F-150s, because of an unexpected downshift

305
00:11:53,639 --> 00:11:56,203
that can cause a loss of control,

306
00:11:56,203 --> 00:11:57,757
according to Motor1.

307
00:11:57,937 --> 00:12:01,404
A separate recall covered forty-four thousand,

308
00:12:01,404 --> 00:12:05,248
nine hundred sixty-three twenty fourteen F-150s for

309
00:12:05,248 --> 00:12:07,132
the same kind of problem.

310
00:12:07,482 --> 00:12:09,548
The road to that recall took years.

311
00:12:09,728 --> 00:12:11,941
According to Ford Authority,

312
00:12:11,941 --> 00:12:15,577
the federal safety agency opened a preliminary

313
00:12:15,577 --> 00:12:19,846
investigation in March twenty twenty-five and upgraded

314
00:12:19,846 --> 00:12:22,929
it in early February twenty twenty-six.

315
00:12:23,109 --> 00:12:26,213
Owners claim the trucks can downshift suddenly

316
00:12:26,213 --> 00:12:29,114
without warning, and some reported at least

317
00:12:29,114 --> 00:12:31,003
one rear wheel lockup event.

318
00:12:31,183 --> 00:12:34,133
Imagine dropping several gears at once,

319
00:12:34,133 --> 00:12:35,419
at highway speed,

320
00:12:35,419 --> 00:12:36,327
in the rain.

321
00:12:36,677 --> 00:12:38,035
Here is the twist.

322
00:12:38,215 --> 00:12:40,679
The cause may not be the transmission's

323
00:12:40,679 --> 00:12:41,501
gears at all.

324
00:12:41,681 --> 00:12:43,732
According to Ford Authority,

325
00:12:43,732 --> 00:12:46,150
Ford believes the root cause is a

326
00:12:46,150 --> 00:12:49,520
supplier production problem with a lead frame,

327
00:12:49,520 --> 00:12:52,524
causing signal loss from the output shaft

328
00:12:52,524 --> 00:12:53,476
speed sensor.

329
00:12:53,656 --> 00:12:56,601
The federal agency also pointed to possible

330
00:12:56,601 --> 00:12:59,682
signal loss in the transmission range sensor.

331
00:12:59,862 --> 00:13:03,062
A tiny electrical part tells the transmission

332
00:13:03,062 --> 00:13:04,200
the wrong thing,

333
00:13:04,200 --> 00:13:06,120
and the transmission obeys.

334
00:13:06,470 --> 00:13:07,427
And in court,

335
00:13:07,427 --> 00:13:09,047
the story keeps going.

336
00:13:09,227 --> 00:13:11,490
In February twenty twenty-six,

337
00:13:11,490 --> 00:13:14,131
in the case O'Connor versus Ford in

338
00:13:14,131 --> 00:13:16,092
federal court in Illinois,

339
00:13:16,092 --> 00:13:19,638
Judge Jeffrey Cummings denied Ford's motion for

340
00:13:19,638 --> 00:13:24,240
partial judgment, letting a Massachusetts consumer protection

341
00:13:24,240 --> 00:13:27,559
claim continue, according to Ford Authority.

342
00:13:27,739 --> 00:13:30,026
That does not mean Ford is liable.

343
00:13:30,206 --> 00:13:31,913
It means the case goes on.

344
00:13:32,093 --> 00:13:32,892
For a buyer,

345
00:13:32,892 --> 00:13:34,891
the practical point is simple.

346
00:13:35,071 --> 00:13:36,114
Check the VIN,

347
00:13:36,114 --> 00:13:38,425
and make sure the recall fix is

348
00:13:38,425 --> 00:13:38,798
done.

349
00:13:39,148 --> 00:13:41,216
There is one more twist hidden in

350
00:13:41,216 --> 00:13:41,969
that recall.

351
00:13:42,149 --> 00:13:45,916
The twenty fifteen to twenty seventeen F-150s

352
00:13:45,916 --> 00:13:48,511
span a change in transmissions.

353
00:13:48,691 --> 00:13:51,948
A reader comment on Ford Authority pointed

354
00:13:51,948 --> 00:13:54,507
out that many of those trucks use

355
00:13:54,507 --> 00:13:56,058
the older six-speed,

356
00:13:56,058 --> 00:13:57,454
not the ten-speed,

357
00:13:57,454 --> 00:14:00,091
and the article did not settle the

358
00:14:00,091 --> 00:14:00,789
question.

359
00:14:00,969 --> 00:14:02,548
That is a useful reminder.

360
00:14:02,728 --> 00:14:05,353
Recalls are written by model year and

361
00:14:05,353 --> 00:14:07,837
build date, not by what owners call

362
00:14:07,837 --> 00:14:09,043
the transmission.

363
00:14:09,223 --> 00:14:11,650
Only the VIN tells you for sure.

364
00:14:12,000 --> 00:14:14,415
And this was not the first time

365
00:14:14,415 --> 00:14:17,375
regulators looked at F-150 downshifts.

366
00:14:17,555 --> 00:14:20,466
According to Law three sixty Canada,

367
00:14:20,466 --> 00:14:24,752
the federal safety agency had investigated unexpected

368
00:14:24,752 --> 00:14:28,795
downshifting on twenty fifteen to twenty seventeen

369
00:14:28,795 --> 00:14:33,081
F-150s, potentially affecting one point three million

370
00:14:33,081 --> 00:14:33,809
vehicles.

371
00:14:33,989 --> 00:14:37,059
So the twenty twenty-six recall was the

372
00:14:37,059 --> 00:14:38,555
end of a long road,

373
00:14:38,555 --> 00:14:39,736
not a surprise.

374
00:14:39,916 --> 00:14:41,948
If you own one of these trucks

375
00:14:41,948 --> 00:14:43,507
and never got a letter,

376
00:14:43,507 --> 00:14:44,862
check the VIN today.

377
00:14:45,212 --> 00:14:49,689
Problem number four is Ford's ten-speed automatic,

378
00:14:49,689 --> 00:14:51,212
the ten R eighty,

379
00:14:51,212 --> 00:14:53,719
which is in a huge number of

380
00:14:53,719 --> 00:14:55,241
Fords, the F-150,

381
00:14:55,241 --> 00:14:58,644
the Ranger, the Expedition and others.

382
00:14:58,824 --> 00:15:01,026
In April twenty twenty-five,

383
00:15:01,026 --> 00:15:03,858
a proposed class action was filed in

384
00:15:03,858 --> 00:15:06,217
Vancouver for Canadian owners,

385
00:15:06,217 --> 00:15:10,228
covering vehicles from model years twenty seventeen

386
00:15:10,228 --> 00:15:12,352
and twenty eighteen onward,

387
00:15:12,352 --> 00:15:15,183
according to Law three sixty Canada.

388
00:15:15,533 --> 00:15:18,006
The complaint lists what owners report.

389
00:15:18,186 --> 00:15:20,322
Difficulty shifting gears.

390
00:15:20,502 --> 00:15:23,370
Unintended lunging when shifting from park to

391
00:15:23,370 --> 00:15:23,753
drive.

392
00:15:23,933 --> 00:15:26,556
Shuddering and shimmying while driving.

393
00:15:26,736 --> 00:15:29,400
Sudden gear shifts the driver did not

394
00:15:29,400 --> 00:15:29,976
request.

395
00:15:30,156 --> 00:15:33,203
And premature wear of transmission parts and

396
00:15:33,203 --> 00:15:34,173
clutch plates.

397
00:15:34,353 --> 00:15:38,645
Transport Canada had looked into unintended downshifting

398
00:15:38,645 --> 00:15:42,248
complaints on twenty seventeen to twenty twenty

399
00:15:42,248 --> 00:15:44,548
F-150s with this transmission,

400
00:15:44,548 --> 00:15:47,077
after eleven consumer complaints.

401
00:15:47,257 --> 00:15:49,378
The class has not been certified,

402
00:15:49,378 --> 00:15:51,950
and the allegations have not been tested

403
00:15:51,950 --> 00:15:52,528
in court.

404
00:15:52,878 --> 00:15:54,375
Here is the twist.

405
00:15:54,555 --> 00:15:57,628
Consumer Reports put the F-150 at the

406
00:15:57,628 --> 00:16:01,530
top of its full-size truck reliability ranking,

407
00:16:01,530 --> 00:16:06,264
and still mentioned ten-speed transmission problems among

408
00:16:06,264 --> 00:16:10,166
owner complaints, according to Pickup Truck and

409
00:16:10,166 --> 00:16:10,914
SUV Talk.

410
00:16:11,094 --> 00:16:12,882
Both things can be true.

411
00:16:13,062 --> 00:16:15,268
A truck can be the most reliable

412
00:16:15,268 --> 00:16:17,267
in its class and still have a

413
00:16:17,267 --> 00:16:19,679
transmission that some owners hate.

414
00:16:19,859 --> 00:16:22,305
Most ten R eighty trucks never have

415
00:16:22,305 --> 00:16:23,563
a serious problem.

416
00:16:23,743 --> 00:16:26,100
Some owners notice harsh shifts.

417
00:16:26,280 --> 00:16:28,938
A smaller number end up with repairs.

418
00:16:29,289 --> 00:16:30,171
What can you do?

419
00:16:30,351 --> 00:16:33,406
Many shift complaints on modern automatics are

420
00:16:33,406 --> 00:16:34,867
handled with software.

421
00:16:35,047 --> 00:16:37,616
The transmission learns how you drive,

422
00:16:37,616 --> 00:16:39,778
and a dealer can reset or update

423
00:16:39,778 --> 00:16:40,725
that learning.

424
00:16:40,905 --> 00:16:43,368
So when you test drive a used

425
00:16:43,368 --> 00:16:44,726
F-150 or Ranger,

426
00:16:44,726 --> 00:16:48,633
ask whether the transmission software has been

427
00:16:48,633 --> 00:16:50,417
updated or relearned,

428
00:16:50,417 --> 00:16:51,946
and drive it cold.

429
00:16:52,126 --> 00:16:54,601
Pay attention to the first shift from

430
00:16:54,601 --> 00:16:55,538
park to drive,

431
00:16:55,538 --> 00:16:58,014
and the shifts below twenty miles per

432
00:16:58,014 --> 00:16:58,349
hour.

433
00:16:58,699 --> 00:17:00,751
Here is the part that ties problems

434
00:17:00,751 --> 00:17:02,158
three and four together.

435
00:17:02,338 --> 00:17:05,625
Ford's ten-speed and GM's ten-speed come from

436
00:17:05,625 --> 00:17:07,598
the same joint development.

437
00:17:07,778 --> 00:17:11,102
And both companies now face complaints about

438
00:17:11,102 --> 00:17:12,840
sudden or harsh shifts.

439
00:17:13,020 --> 00:17:15,783
Ford's recall points to a sensor signal.

440
00:17:15,963 --> 00:17:18,087
GM's points to valve wear.

441
00:17:18,267 --> 00:17:20,740
Different causes, similar symptoms.

442
00:17:20,920 --> 00:17:21,924
For a driver,

443
00:17:21,924 --> 00:17:23,776
the feeling is the same.

444
00:17:23,956 --> 00:17:25,756
The truck does something you did not

445
00:17:25,756 --> 00:17:26,406
ask it to do.

446
00:17:26,756 --> 00:17:29,491
Problem number five shows that no brand

447
00:17:29,491 --> 00:17:30,192
is immune.

448
00:17:30,372 --> 00:17:32,761
In February twenty twenty-four,

449
00:17:32,761 --> 00:17:36,537
Toyota recalled about two hundred eighty thousand

450
00:17:36,537 --> 00:17:37,769
trucks and SUVs,

451
00:17:37,769 --> 00:17:41,622
twenty twenty-two and twenty twenty-three Tundras,

452
00:17:41,622 --> 00:17:43,317
Lexus LX six hundreds,

453
00:17:43,317 --> 00:17:47,632
and twenty twenty-three and twenty twenty-four Sequoias,

454
00:17:47,632 --> 00:17:50,792
because parts of the transmission may not

455
00:17:50,792 --> 00:17:54,490
immediately disengage when shifted into neutral,

456
00:17:54,490 --> 00:17:57,110
according to the Associated Press.

457
00:17:57,290 --> 00:17:59,319
The vehicle could creep forward at low

458
00:17:59,319 --> 00:18:01,295
speed if the brakes were not applied.

459
00:18:01,646 --> 00:18:04,293
The fix was a free software update.

460
00:18:04,473 --> 00:18:07,085
Toyota would not say whether there had

461
00:18:07,085 --> 00:18:08,803
been crashes or injuries.

462
00:18:08,983 --> 00:18:11,112
And the twist is that this came

463
00:18:11,112 --> 00:18:14,546
on the same new-generation Tundra whose twin-turbo

464
00:18:14,546 --> 00:18:17,087
engine would be recalled three times.

465
00:18:17,267 --> 00:18:20,340
Toyota's reputation was built on the old

466
00:18:20,340 --> 00:18:20,878
Tundra.

467
00:18:21,058 --> 00:18:22,865
The new one has had to earn

468
00:18:22,865 --> 00:18:23,936
it the hard way,

469
00:18:23,936 --> 00:18:26,547
with an engine story and a transmission

470
00:18:26,547 --> 00:18:28,221
story in its first years.

471
00:18:28,571 --> 00:18:31,915
And heavy-duty trucks have their own transmission

472
00:18:31,915 --> 00:18:32,530
concerns.

473
00:18:32,710 --> 00:18:35,701
According to Pickup Truck and SUV Talk's

474
00:18:35,701 --> 00:18:38,093
report on Consumer Reports data,

475
00:18:38,093 --> 00:18:42,281
some twenty twenty-four and twenty twenty-five Silverado

476
00:18:42,281 --> 00:18:46,020
heavy-duty owners reported valve body failures and

477
00:18:46,020 --> 00:18:48,338
full transmission replacements,

478
00:18:48,338 --> 00:18:51,478
and GM ran a customer satisfaction program

479
00:18:51,478 --> 00:18:54,694
for a transmission bearing issue on certain

480
00:18:54,694 --> 00:18:56,638
twenty twenty-four trucks.

481
00:18:56,818 --> 00:18:58,823
On Ram heavy-duty trucks,

482
00:18:58,823 --> 00:19:02,433
software problems left some trucks limited to

483
00:19:02,433 --> 00:19:04,760
about fifteen miles per hour,

484
00:19:04,760 --> 00:19:07,487
or made tow haul mode unavailable.

485
00:19:07,838 --> 00:19:10,325
A truck stuck at fifteen miles per

486
00:19:10,325 --> 00:19:12,667
hour with a trailer behind it is

487
00:19:12,667 --> 00:19:14,130
not a small problem.

488
00:19:14,310 --> 00:19:17,551
And a customer satisfaction program is not

489
00:19:17,551 --> 00:19:18,246
a recall.

490
00:19:18,426 --> 00:19:20,493
It is a goodwill repair that may

491
00:19:20,493 --> 00:19:22,431
have conditions and deadlines.

492
00:19:22,611 --> 00:19:23,514
That is why,

493
00:19:23,514 --> 00:19:25,093
on heavy-duty trucks,

494
00:19:25,093 --> 00:19:28,102
the service history matters just as much

495
00:19:28,102 --> 00:19:29,531
as the recall list.

496
00:19:29,711 --> 00:19:31,615
Ask the dealer to print both.

497
00:19:31,965 --> 00:19:34,606
So what does a failing transmission feel

498
00:19:34,606 --> 00:19:35,993
like before it fails?

499
00:19:36,173 --> 00:19:39,205
The symptoms in these recalls and lawsuits

500
00:19:39,205 --> 00:19:40,504
are a useful list.

501
00:19:40,684 --> 00:19:42,843
Harsh or delayed shifts.

502
00:19:43,023 --> 00:19:44,962
A shudder at steady speed.

503
00:19:45,142 --> 00:19:46,965
A lunge from park to drive.

504
00:19:47,145 --> 00:19:48,515
A sudden downshift.

505
00:19:48,695 --> 00:19:51,539
A warning message about reduced propulsion.

506
00:19:51,719 --> 00:19:53,194
Creeping in neutral.

507
00:19:53,374 --> 00:19:55,191
If you feel any of these on

508
00:19:55,191 --> 00:19:56,066
a test drive,

509
00:19:56,066 --> 00:19:58,018
do not let anyone tell you it

510
00:19:58,018 --> 00:19:59,701
is normal for this truck.

511
00:19:59,881 --> 00:20:01,379
Ask for it in writing.

512
00:20:01,729 --> 00:20:04,300
So what is the pattern across all

513
00:20:04,300 --> 00:20:04,689
five?

514
00:20:04,869 --> 00:20:08,175
Modern truck transmissions are not just gears

515
00:20:08,175 --> 00:20:08,909
and fluid.

516
00:20:09,089 --> 00:20:10,533
They are computers,

517
00:20:10,533 --> 00:20:12,433
sensors and valve bodies.

518
00:20:12,613 --> 00:20:15,103
Ford's downshift may come from a sensor

519
00:20:15,103 --> 00:20:15,550
signal.

520
00:20:15,730 --> 00:20:18,362
GM's lockup comes from valve wear,

521
00:20:18,362 --> 00:20:20,142
controlled by software.

522
00:20:20,322 --> 00:20:23,794
Toyota's neutral problem was fixed with software.

523
00:20:23,974 --> 00:20:26,263
And the most common fix for all

524
00:20:26,263 --> 00:20:28,404
of them is a software update,

525
00:20:28,404 --> 00:20:31,506
which can stop the danger without stopping

526
00:20:31,506 --> 00:20:32,170
the wear.

527
00:20:32,521 --> 00:20:34,494
And here is the final twist.

528
00:20:34,674 --> 00:20:37,516
In court, the manufacturers are winning more

529
00:20:37,516 --> 00:20:39,260
often than you might think.

530
00:20:39,440 --> 00:20:42,621
GM won its eight-speed appeal.

531
00:20:42,801 --> 00:20:45,777
The death wobble case against Ford lost

532
00:20:45,777 --> 00:20:48,142
its class status on appeal too.

533
00:20:48,322 --> 00:20:51,282
That means if your transmission fails after

534
00:20:51,282 --> 00:20:54,173
the warranty, a class action probably will

535
00:20:54,173 --> 00:20:55,067
not save you.

536
00:20:55,247 --> 00:20:57,726
Your best protection is buying the right

537
00:20:57,726 --> 00:20:59,585
truck, with the right records,

538
00:20:59,585 --> 00:21:00,762
in the first place.

539
00:21:01,112 --> 00:21:03,592
Here is your transmission checklist for twenty

540
00:21:03,592 --> 00:21:04,293
twenty-seven.

541
00:21:04,473 --> 00:21:06,979
One, run the VIN for recalls and

542
00:21:06,979 --> 00:21:10,034
confirm the software updates were done.

543
00:21:10,214 --> 00:21:14,511
Two, ask for the transmission service history,

544
00:21:14,511 --> 00:21:17,407
fluid changes, valve body work,

545
00:21:17,407 --> 00:21:18,248
relearns.

546
00:21:18,428 --> 00:21:20,526
Three, drive the truck cold,

547
00:21:20,526 --> 00:21:22,999
and feel every shift from park to

548
00:21:22,999 --> 00:21:25,847
drive and below twenty miles per hour.

549
00:21:26,027 --> 00:21:28,399
Four, cruise at forty to sixty on

550
00:21:28,399 --> 00:21:30,915
a smooth road and feel for shudder.

551
00:21:31,095 --> 00:21:33,992
Five, if it is a heavy-duty truck,

552
00:21:33,992 --> 00:21:35,611
test tow haul mode.

553
00:21:35,961 --> 00:21:37,342
And one last tip.

554
00:21:37,522 --> 00:21:39,791
If the truck is still under the

555
00:21:39,791 --> 00:21:43,085
powertrain warranty, find out exactly when it

556
00:21:43,085 --> 00:21:45,208
ends, in months and in miles.

557
00:21:45,388 --> 00:21:48,362
A transmission problem that appears one month

558
00:21:48,362 --> 00:21:50,543
before the warranty ends is free.

559
00:21:50,723 --> 00:21:53,602
One month after can cost thousands.

560
00:21:53,782 --> 00:21:55,569
We put all of this into the

561
00:21:55,569 --> 00:21:58,217
Twenty Twenty-Seven Truck Buyer's Guide.

562
00:21:58,397 --> 00:22:00,505
